<!-- Значки из набора EliteSIP (EliteSIP.App.Theme.Icons.xaml, сетка 20×20; свойства обводки переведены на имена Avalonia) — один стиль в обоих приложениях.
     Цвет берётся из Foreground ближайшего app:Icon. -->
<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
                    xmlns:app="using:EliteRec.App">
  <Canvas x:Key="mic.fill" x:Shared="False" Width="20" Height="20">
    <Path Data="M 10,2.2 H 10 A 2.4,2.4 0 0 1 12.4,4.6 V 9 A 2.4,2.4 0 0 1 10,11.4 H 10 A 2.4,2.4 0 0 1 7.6,9 V 4.6 A 2.4,2.4 0 0 1 10,2.2 Z" Fill="{Binding Foreground, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=app:Icon}}" />
    <Path Data="M5 9.6v1.2a5 5 0 0 0 10 0V9.6" Stroke="{Binding Foreground, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=app:Icon}}" StrokeThickness="1.5" StrokeLineCap="Round" />
    <Path Data="M10 15.9v1.9M7.3 17.8h5.4" Stroke="{Binding Foreground, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=app:Icon}}" StrokeThickness="1.5" StrokeLineCap="Round" />
  </Canvas>

  <Canvas x:Key="speaker.wave.2" x:Shared="False" Width="20" Height="20">
    <Path Data="M9.4 3.3 5.2 6.9H2.6c-.6 0-1.1.5-1.1 1.1v4c0 .6.5 1.1 1.1 1.1h2.6l4.2 3.6c.7.6 1.7.1 1.7-.8V4.1c0-.9-1-1.4-1.7-.8z" Fill="{Binding Foreground, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=app:Icon}}" />
    <Path Data="M13.6 7.4a3.7 3.7 0 0 1 0 5.2" Stroke="{Binding Foreground, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=app:Icon}}" StrokeThickness="1.5" StrokeLineCap="Round" />
    <Path Data="M16.2 5a7.2 7.2 0 0 1 0 10" Stroke="{Binding Foreground, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=app:Icon}}" StrokeThickness="1.5" StrokeLineCap="Round" />
  </Canvas>

  <Canvas x:Key="gearshape" x:Shared="False" Width="20" Height="20">
    <Path Data="M16.01 7.81 18.22 8.25 18.22 11.75 16.01 12.19A6.4 6.4 0 0 1 15.80 12.70L17.04 14.57 14.57 17.04 12.70 15.80A6.4 6.4 0 0 1 12.19 16.01L11.75 18.22 8.25 18.22 7.81 16.01A6.4 6.4 0 0 1 7.30 15.80L5.43 17.04 2.96 14.57 4.20 12.70A6.4 6.4 0 0 1 3.99 12.19L1.78 11.75 1.78 8.25 3.99 7.81A6.4 6.4 0 0 1 4.20 7.30L2.96 5.43 5.43 2.96 7.30 4.20A6.4 6.4 0 0 1 7.81 3.99L8.25 1.78 11.75 1.78 12.19 3.99A6.4 6.4 0 0 1 12.70 4.20L14.57 2.96 17.04 5.43 15.80 7.30A6.4 6.4 0 0 1 16.01 7.81Z" Stroke="{Binding Foreground, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=app:Icon}}" StrokeThickness="1.4" StrokeJoin="Round" />
    <Path Data="M 7.4,10 A 2.6,2.6 0 1 0 12.6,10 A 2.6,2.6 0 1 0 7.4,10 Z" Stroke="{Binding Foreground, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=app:Icon}}" StrokeThickness="1.4" />
  </Canvas>

  <Canvas x:Key="pause.fill" x:Shared="False" Width="20" Height="20">
    <Path Data="M 6.5,3.6 H 7.3 A 1.3,1.3 0 0 1 8.6,4.9 V 15.1 A 1.3,1.3 0 0 1 7.3,16.4 H 6.5 A 1.3,1.3 0 0 1 5.2,15.1 V 4.9 A 1.3,1.3 0 0 1 6.5,3.6 Z" Fill="{Binding Foreground, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=app:Icon}}" />
    <Path Data="M 12.7,3.6 H 13.5 A 1.3,1.3 0 0 1 14.8,4.9 V 15.1 A 1.3,1.3 0 0 1 13.5,16.4 H 12.7 A 1.3,1.3 0 0 1 11.4,15.1 V 4.9 A 1.3,1.3 0 0 1 12.7,3.6 Z" Fill="{Binding Foreground, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=app:Icon}}" />
  </Canvas>

  <Canvas x:Key="play.fill" x:Shared="False" Width="20" Height="20">
    <Path Data="M5.8 4.1c0-.9 1-1.5 1.8-1l8.8 5.9c.7.5.7 1.5 0 2l-8.8 5.9c-.8.5-1.8-.1-1.8-1z" Fill="{Binding Foreground, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=app:Icon}}" />
  </Canvas>

  <Canvas x:Key="chevron.down" x:Shared="False" Width="20" Height="20">
    <Path Data="M5.2 7.6 10 12.4 14.8 7.6" Stroke="{Binding Foreground, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=app:Icon}}" StrokeThickness="1.8" StrokeLineCap="Round" StrokeJoin="Round" />
  </Canvas>

  <Canvas x:Key="checkmark.circle" x:Shared="False" Width="20" Height="20">
    <Path Data="M 1.7,10 A 8.3,8.3 0 1 0 18.3,10 A 8.3,8.3 0 1 0 1.7,10 Z" Stroke="{Binding Foreground, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=app:Icon}}" StrokeThickness="1.5" />
    <Path Data="m6 10.3 2.7 2.7 5.5-5.5" Stroke="{Binding Foreground, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=app:Icon}}" StrokeThickness="1.6" StrokeLineCap="Round" StrokeJoin="Round" />
  </Canvas>

  <Canvas x:Key="exclamationmark.circle" x:Shared="False" Width="20" Height="20">
    <Path Data="M 1.7,10 A 8.3,8.3 0 1 0 18.3,10 A 8.3,8.3 0 1 0 1.7,10 Z" Stroke="{Binding Foreground, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=app:Icon}}" StrokeThickness="1.5" />
    <Path Data="M10 5.6v5.2" Stroke="{Binding Foreground, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=app:Icon}}" StrokeThickness="1.6" StrokeLineCap="Round" />
    <Path Data="M 9,13.7 A 1,1 0 1 0 11,13.7 A 1,1 0 1 0 9,13.7 Z" Fill="{Binding Foreground, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=app:Icon}}" />
  </Canvas>

  <!-- Папки в наборе EliteSIP нет — нарисована в той же манере (сетка 20, линия 1.5, скругления). -->
  <Canvas x:Key="folder" x:Shared="False" Width="20" Height="20">
    <Path Data="M2.4 5.6c0-.9.7-1.6 1.6-1.6h3.5l1.8 2h6.7c.9 0 1.6.7 1.6 1.6v7.2c0 .9-.7 1.6-1.6 1.6H4c-.9 0-1.6-.7-1.6-1.6z" Stroke="{Binding Foreground, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=app:Icon}}" StrokeThickness="1.5" StrokeJoin="Round" />
    <Path Data="M2.4 8.6h15.2" Stroke="{Binding Foreground, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=app:Icon}}" StrokeThickness="1.5" StrokeLineCap="Round" />
  </Canvas>
</ResourceDictionary>
